The idea of driving a whole-sequence camera move (pan / zoom / rotate) from an
easing curve over the frame index was inspired by ComfyUI-AstralAnimator. That
project publishes no license file, so no source code, data or assets from it were
copied, ported or adapted. APNGCameraMove is independent work built on
torch.nn.functional.affine_grid + grid_sample, and it does not re-sample frames.

